[[The Amplified]] is a part of the server which contains amplified terrain. It is home to [[BAT Headquarters 2.0]], BAT's secret vault and [[ApexPoint]]. Spoke used to live in a castle in the Amplified before [[Season 3]]. [[Quackenstein123|Quakenstein123]]'s family used to live before [[Bounty Assassin Team|BAT]] destroyed their home and they were forced to move back to the snowy biome. [[ParrotX2]] once arrived in another part of the Amplified to rescue a [[Treebo Village]] member from the base of bandits named [[the Phantoms]] and then defend the whole village from these bandits. It also was home to [[TheRealSquiddo|Squiddo]] before Spoke burnt it down.

