[[The Forge]] is a location referred to by [[mxterwu]], which likely a place to dupe weapon-related items (like maces and bottles of experience) and structures (like orbital strike cannons). [[Wemmbu]] found a large amount of orbital strike cannons and other machines, which he believed to be the Forge, though [[Serpentbound333]] said that it wasn't. The last structure in the flower which Eggchan fell into in Wemmbu's video [[I Explored the Minecraft Farlands]] likely refers to the Forge.

